els": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.6.1.0\nFixed PvE Casual mode difficulty issue\nFixed quest jittering issue\nImproved Quest performance\nImproved AI spreading\nAttempted to improve flashlight performance on Quest\nAdjusted shooting accuracy for high-level scav AI\nFixed an issue where some missions could not be completed\nFixed an issue where PMC AI could appear in PvP mode\nFixed an issue with abnormal HQ facility unlocks\nFixed an issue where keys could be placed in the secure container\nFixed an issue with incorrect portraits in the character selection screen\nFixed an issue where materials from upgraded HQ facilities could not be retrieved\nFixed an issue where mail reward icons could display incorrectly\nFixed an issue where some players might spawn on the mall roof\nFixed an issue where purchasing magazines could cause a server restart\nFixed an issue with UI in BR might disappear\nFixed an issue where bullet impact effects would not display in multiplayer mode", "created_date": 1776980781, "id": "24927151640316109", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 297, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "24927129186985021"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24927151640316109"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.6.1.0\nFixed PvE Casual mode difficulty issue\nImproved Quest performance\nImproved AI spreading\nAttempted to improve flashlight performance on Quest\nAdjusted shooting accuracy for high-level scav AI\nFixed an issue where some missions could not be completed\nFixed an issue where PMC AI could appear in PvP mode\nFixed an issue with abnormal HQ facility unlocks\nFixed an issue where keys could be placed in the secure container\nFixed an issue with incorrect portraits in the character selection screen\nFixed an issue where materials from upgraded HQ facilities could not be retrieved\nFixed an issue where mail reward icons could display incorrectly\nFixed an issue where some players might spawn on the mall roof\nFixed an issue where purchasing magazines could cause a server restart\nFixed an issue with UI in BR might disappear\nFixed an issue where bullet impact effects would not display in multiplayer mode", "created_date": 1776972086, "id": "24925961443768462", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 296, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "24925933960437877"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24927151640316109"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1776962569, "id": "24924472563917350", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 295, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "24924459647251975"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24927151640316109"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes v1.6.0.0\n\nNew Features\nPvE Mode\n\u25cf Introduced the new PvE Mode, offering a dedicated co-op experience for players looking for a more accessible and structured way to enter ExfilZone\n\u25cf Added two difficulty options: Casual and Standard\n\u25cf Squad-based PvE can now be unlocked through the party leader purchasing the DLC\n\u25cf Added PMC AI\nAll-New AI\n\u25cf Smarter behavior logic\n\u25cf More reasonable AI distribution\n\u25cf Better difficulty scaling for a more layered combat experience\n\u25cf Added new Elite SCAVs\n\u25cf Increased the chance for AI backpacks to contain a wider variety of random loot\nEconomy System Overhaul\n\u25cf Fully rebalanced the economy system for a healthier income/spending loop\n\u25cf Jonny: Added a new Restock feature for more stable replenishment\n\u25cf Higher risk now comes with higher rewards\n\u25cf Added both weekly and daily shop refresh rules for better control over item quality distribution\n\u25cf Adjusted item values\n\u25cf Armor, helmets, and other protective gear looted from SCAVs may now come with varying durability damage, affecting both durability and protection level\n\u25cf Improved backend systems to better prevent item duplication issues\nDynamic Weather System\n\u25cf Outdoor maps now have a chance to trigger special weather conditions such as rain and fog\n\u25cf Even in clear weather, outdoor maps now feature more varied environmental atmosphere\nAdditional New Systems\n\u25cf Added a Dog Tag system\n\u25cf Added an Equipment Voucher system\n\u25cf Added Equipment Skin customization\n\u25cf Added a Daily Login Reward event\n\u25cf Added information display while holding items\n\u25cf Added key requirement display when gripping a door handle\nNew Equipment\n\u25cf Mystica Ranch Backpack\n\u25cf Operator Backpack\n\u25cf IBH SOCOM Helmet\n\u25cf CCBM Ballistic Mask\n\u25cf Galvor Tactical Helmet\n\u25cf Galvor Ballistic Goggles\n\u25cf Maska-1Sch\n\u25cf Maska-1Sch Face Shield\n\u25cf 6B5-16 Khaki Body Armor\n\u25cf 6B23-1 Body Armor\n\u25cf 6B23-2 Body Armor\n\u25cf TBAS V5 MC Plate Carrier Vest\n\u25cf TBAS V5 BK Plate Carrier Vest\n\u25cf CenturionV3 SAPI Plate Carrier MC\n\u25cf CenturionV3 SAPI Plate Carrier SD\n\u25cf CenturionV3 SAPI Plate Carrier TG\n\u25cf 6B45 \"Ratnik\" Plate Carrier\nOptimizations, Adjustments, and Bug Fixes\n\u25cf Adjusted Hideout facility layout and functions for an upgraded base management experience\n\u25cf Added Kiosk Direct Sale, allowing players to sell items directly for more convenient cash conversion\n\u25cf Adjusted the quest line with improved mission flow and crafting logic for a smoother onboarding experience\n\u25cf Improved difficulty information display for maps: Dam, Suburb, and Resort\n\u25cf Removed the ability to place keys inside the secure container\n\u25cf Adjusted the Halloween DLC content: removed daily purchasable Halloween gear from the shop, and replaced it with 1 set of spray items plus skin unlocks\n\u25cf Removed the ability to place grenades inside the secure container\n\u25cf Reduced shotgun spread by 20%\n\u25cf Reduced bleed chance for all ammunition by 50%\n\u25cf Reduced penetration power of 7.62x54R SP rounds from 2.8 to 2.1\n\u25cf Separated the volume of enemy and player footsteps; re-balanced footstep sounds on grass and mud surfaces\n\u25cf Reworked backpack capacities and removed the Elite Ops Backpack\u2019s ability to carry armor\n\u25cf Adjusted stock and prices of armor, backpacks, and other protective gear in the shop\n\u25cf Adjusted ammunition prices and shop stock\n\u25cf Adjusted unlock levels and requirements for some ammo and armor\n\u25cf Adjusted starting stash items\n\u25cf Optimized helmet protection zone calculations based on each helmet\u2019s visual model, fixing issues that could cause abnormal protection detection\n\u25cf Closed armor armpit gaps, preventing bullets from bypassing armor and directly hitting the chest\n\u25cf Increased the minimum protection level retained when armor durability drops\n\u25cf Reduced penetration chance when bullet penetration is close to the protection level of helmets, armor, and face shields\n\u25cf Adjusted the character\u2019s default food and hydration limits\n\u25cf Fixed an issue where weapons with non-detachable magazines, such as shotguns, SKS, and Mosin, would lose their magazine ammo after entering a raid\n\u25cf Fixed an issue where picked-up weapons with non-detachable magazines had no ammo\n\u25cf Fixed an issue where weapons dropped by AI with non-repairable magazines had no ammo when picked up\n\u25cf Fixed an issue where AI used incorrect ammo tiers; high-level AI will now use stronger ammunition\n\u25cf Improved AI weapon drop logic: dropped weapons now contain a random amount of the actual ammo type the AI was using, and will be chambered\n\u25cf Improved visual quality of some environmental model textures\n\u25cf Improved visual presentation of northern conifer forest trees\n\u25cf Fixed some map clipping issues\n\u25cf Fixed gaps in some building models\n\u25cf Improved performance in certain areas\n\u25cf Enhanced visual quality of some terrain materials\n\u25cf Improved physical material effects on some ground surfaces", "created_date": 1776806194, "id": "24904071079290832", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 294, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "24904067875957819"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "24927151640316109"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1776789156, "id": "24901780216186585", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 293, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "24901776879520252"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}